    "basis_set": "Single-band Hubbard model; JW ordering [s1↑,s1↓,s2↑,s2↓,s3↑,s3↓,s4↑,s4↓] → 8 qubits",
    "hamiltonian": "8-qubit JW Hamiltonian with PBC. ~32 Pauli terms. Solver must compute exact coefficients with OpenFermion.",
    "additional_support": "PBC introduces long-range JW string across the ring boundary. Bethe Ansatz reference available for any t, U."
